# The gate's machine-readable test result, kept only for the run that just happened. Written every run so that an
# intermittent failure names itself in a file rather than scrolling past in a summary — see docs/design/code-standards.md.
.vitest-last-run.json

# Built dictionary assets — regenerated by `pnpm build:wordnet`, published as release artifacts, never committed.
dist-assets/

# What a failed end-to-end test leaves: a screenshot, and any output that differed from its golden file
e2e/.out/
